 "notes": "Tenor saxophone, straight tone (no vibrato), middle VCSL layer (mf), mono. Whole-tone sampled: G#2-E6 (top notes are altissimo). Every file has a seamless sustain loop (C4 needed a slight level-drift correction). Add delayed vibrato (5-6 Hz, ~15 cents) in the engine for a jazzier sound. Recommended release 0.12-0.18 s."
